# Eleanor Rigby, refrain (figure 93.3)
# The chromatic inner line over the implied harmony; Pollack puts the A in parentheses (implied,
# a passing IV under the C#); kept so here.
#? Octave of the inner line (D4 down to B3, string register) is a guess.
key e

system
caption 2X
voice "Inner voice"        | D4 | C#4 | Cn4 | B3 |
chords "Implied harmony"   | e{i7} | (A){IV} | C{VI} | e{i} |
